#
# Drivers find their devices in the device tree the previous stage passes
# (include/driver.h); the addresses some of them have here are what they
# fall back on without one.
#
# Drivers, one directory per class (serial, timer, irqchip, ipi, reset,
# iopmp, ...). Each drivers/<class>/ has a Kconfig and a sub.mk and is
# discovered automatically (drivers/sub.mk).

menu "Drivers"

source "drivers/*/Kconfig"

endmenu
